  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As I understood, when CL will be released, worlds will be automatically publishing and there is no way to stop that!\n\nI think it would be better to make something like \"Hold in CL\" checkbox. If this enabled on CL world, it will not became public just when system decides it's good. System should send notification to world author something like \"your world is ready to be public\". After that author can confirm publication (or ignore it, to hold world in CL for some time)",
